{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1220107-paradox-ceo-asks-for-exalted-developers-to-pitch-them-a-computer-game","id":1220107,"title":"Paradox CEO asks for Exalted developers to pitch them a computer game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-18T15:25:04-07:00","id":1220107,"title":"Paradox CEO asks for Exalted developers to pitch them a computer game","content":"<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/videos/262666195\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.twitch.tv/videos/262666195</a> 31minutes in.<br /> <br /> As a big fan of Paradox games and of course Exalted I was very thrilled to hear their CEO say he thinks Exalted 3e was really good and outright say in a stream to ask for a dev to come pitch them something. Even if it isn't something viable right now for the game line this kind of interest has to be cool to hear. My Exalted video game dreams are more realistic than I thought!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/BogMod\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/BogMod</a> I play a lot of videogames.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/131-bogmod","name":"BogMod","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar131_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"136"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T15:27:27-07:00","id":1220108,"title":"","content":"I'd play a Crusader Kings type game where you play as the Scarlet Empress trying to take over Creation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"a